{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/isSwiftSixLanguageMode"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"this library","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" was compiled in Swift 6 language mode."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when built by a 6.0+ toolchain, which selects ","type":"text"},{"code":"Package@swift-6.0.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its per-target language-mode setting. Reported rather than assumed, because the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"difference is invisible from the outside and decides whether the concurrency","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"guarantees were checked or merely intended.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This reads the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"language mode"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", not the toolchain: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"#if swift(>=6.0)"},{"text":" tests the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"former and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"#if compiler(>=6.0)"},{"text":" the latter, and they genuinely differ in this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"package. On a 6.x toolchain the library and the examples are built in Swift 6","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"mode while the test target is deliberately still built in Swift 5 mode — the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"library and examples compile clean under full strict-concurrency checking and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"test harness does not, so scoping the mode to the targets that actually ship is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what makes the guarantee about the artifact you get rather than about a rewrite of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the test suite.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/supportedversions\/isswiftsixlanguagemode"]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK17SupportedVersionsO22isSwiftSixLanguageModeSbvpZ","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Type Property","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}],"title":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/SupportedVersions/isSwiftSixLanguageMode":{"role":"symbol","title":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}],"identifier":"doc